{"questions":[{"question_id":"luz2uzox","content":"<p>Identify the incorrect statements regarding primary standard of titrimetric analysis.</p>\n<p>(A) It should be purely available in dry form.</p>\n<p>(B) It should not undergo chemical change in air.</p>\n<p>(C) It should be hygroscopic and should react with another chemical instantaneously and stoichiometrically.</p>\n<p>(D) It should be readily soluble in water.</p>\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &amp; <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be used as primary standard.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>","chapter":"practical-organic-chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift","permalink":"pidentify-the-incorrect-statements-regarding-primary-stand-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-9n9obxt3fqi7voaf","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Identify the incorrect statements regarding primary standard of titrimetric analysis.</p>\n<p>(A) It should be purely available in dry form.</p>\n<p>(B) It should not undergo chemical change in air.</p>\n<p>(C) It should be hygroscopic and should react with another chemical instantaneously and stoichiometrically.</p>\n<p>(D) It should be readily soluble in water.</p>\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &amp; <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be used as primary standard.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(C) and (E) only"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(A) and (B) only"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(B) and (E) only"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(C) and (D) only"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Let's evaluate each statement to identify the incorrect ones regarding the primary standard in titrimetric analysis:</p>\n\n<p>(A) It should be purely available in dry form.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is generally correct. A primary standard should be pure and available in a stable, dry form to ensure accurate weight measurements.</p>\n\n<p>(B) It should not undergo chemical change in air.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is also correct. A primary standard should be stable in air and not react with components of the atmosphere such as oxygen or carbon dioxide.</p>\n\n<p>(C) It should be hygroscopic and should react with another chemical instantaneously and stoichiometrically.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. A primary standard should not be hygroscopic (it should not absorb moisture from the air) because hygroscopic substances cannot maintain a constant weight. The part about reacting stoichiometrically and instantaneously is generally correct, but being hygroscopic disqualifies a substance from being a primary standard.</p>\n\n<p>(D) It should be readily soluble in water.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is correct. A primary standard should be soluble in water to ensure that it can be dissolved to make a standard solution for titration.</p>\n\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &amp; <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be used as primary standard.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. Both <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (potassium permanganate) and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (sodium hydroxide) are not suitable as primary standards. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is unstable and can decompose, while <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is hygroscopic, which makes precise weight measurements difficult.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is:</p>\n\n<p>Option A</p>\n\n<p>(C) and (E) only</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>अनुमापनात्मक विश्लेपण में प्राथमिक मानक के संदर्भ में असत्य कथनों को पहचानें :</p>\n<p>(A) इसे शुष्क अवस्था में शुद्ध रूप में उपलव्ध होना चाहिए।</p>\n<p>(B) इसे हवा में रासायनिक परिवतिंत नहीं होना चाहिए।</p>\n<p>(C) इसे आर्द्वताग्राही होना चाहिए तथा अन्य रसायनों के साथ तुरंत एवं स्टाइकियोमीद्रिक प्रकार से अभिक्रिया करना चाहिए।</p>\n<p>(D) इसे जल में आसानी के साथ विलेय होना चाहिए।</p>\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> एवं <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> के प्राथमिक मानक के रूप में उपयोग किया जा सकता है।</p>\n<p>नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सही उत्तर चुने :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.43ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2400 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><text data-variant=\"italic\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\">क</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><text data-variant=\"italic\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\">े</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1200,0)\"><text data-variant=\"italic\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\">व</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1800,0)\"><text data-variant=\"italic\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\" font-family=\"serif\" font-style=\"italic\">ल</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.394ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 1500 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1111,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>$ एवं (E)\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"केवल (A) एवं (B)\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"केवल (B) एवं (E)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"केवल (C) एवं (D)\n"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>टाइट्रिमितीय विश्लेषण में प्राथमिक मानक के संबंध में गलत कथनों की पहचान करने के लिए आइए प्रत्येक कथन का मूल्यांकन करें:</p>\n\n<p>(A) यह शुष्क रूप में शुद्ध रूप से उपलब्ध होना चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>यह कथन सामान्यतः सही है। प्राथमिक मानक शुद्ध होना चाहिए और सटीक भार माप सुनिश्चित करने के लिए स्थिर, शुष्क रूप में उपलब्ध होना चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>(B) इसे वायु में रासायनिक परिवर्तन नहीं होना चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>यह कथन भी सही है। प्राथमिक मानक वायु में स्थिर होना चाहिए और वायुमंडल के घटकों जैसे ऑक्सीजन या कार्बन डाइऑक्साइड के साथ प्रतिक्रिया नहीं करनी चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>(C) यह आर्द्रताग्राही होना चाहिए और तुरंत और स्टोइकियोमीट्रिक रूप से किसी अन्य रसायन के साथ प्रतिक्रिया करनी चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>यह कथन गलत है। प्राथमिक मानक आर्द्रताग्राही नहीं होना चाहिए (इसे वायु से नमी अवशोषित नहीं करनी चाहिए) क्योंकि आर्द्रताग्राही पदार्थ स्थिर भार बनाए नहीं रख सकते। स्टोइकियोमीट्रिक और तत्काल प्रतिक्रिया करने वाला भाग सामान्यतः सही है, लेकिन आर्द्रताग्राही होना किसी पदार्थ को प्राथमिक मानक होने से अयोग्य ठहराता है।</p>\n\n<p>(D) यह जल में आसानी से घुलनशील होना चाहिए।</p>\n\n<p>यह कथन सही है। प्राथमिक मानक जल में घुलनशील होना चाहिए ताकि यह सुनिश्चित हो सके कि इसे अनुमापन के लिए मानक विलयन बनाने हेतु घोला जा सके।</p>\n\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &amp; <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> को प्राथमिक मानक के रूप में उपयोग किया जा सकता है।</p>\n\n<p>यह कथन गलत है। <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (पोटैशियम परमैंगनेट) और <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (सोडियम हाइड्रॉक्साइड) दोनों ही प्राथमिक मानक के रूप में उपयुक्त नहीं हैं। <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> अस्थिर है और विघटित हो सकता है, जबकि <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> आर्द्रताग्राही है, जो सटीक भार माप को कठिन बनाता है।</p>\n\n<p>अतः, सही उत्तर है:</p>\n\n<p>विकल्प A</p>\n\n<p>(C) और (E) केवल</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"chemistry-involved-in-titrimetric-experiments","type":"mcq","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(C) and (E) only"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(A) and (B) only"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(B) and (E) only"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(C) and (D) only"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>Let's evaluate each statement to identify the incorrect ones regarding the primary standard in titrimetric analysis:</p>\n\n<p>(A) It should be purely available in dry form.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is generally correct. A primary standard should be pure and available in a stable, dry form to ensure accurate weight measurements.</p>\n\n<p>(B) It should not undergo chemical change in air.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is also correct. A primary standard should be stable in air and not react with components of the atmosphere such as oxygen or carbon dioxide.</p>\n\n<p>(C) It should be hygroscopic and should react with another chemical instantaneously and stoichiometrically.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. A primary standard should not be hygroscopic (it should not absorb moisture from the air) because hygroscopic substances cannot maintain a constant weight. The part about reacting stoichiometrically and instantaneously is generally correct, but being hygroscopic disqualifies a substance from being a primary standard.</p>\n\n<p>(D) It should be readily soluble in water.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is correct. A primary standard should be soluble in water to ensure that it can be dissolved to make a standard solution for titration.</p>\n\n<p>(E) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> &amp; <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can be used as primary standard.</p>\n\n<p>This statement is incorrect. Both <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (potassium permanganate) and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (sodium hydroxide) are not suitable as primary standards. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.841ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3465.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(1695,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(2251,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3062,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is unstable and can decompose, while <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.285ex\" height=\"1.645ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2778 727\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1250,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(2028,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is hygroscopic, which makes precise weight measurements difficult.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is:</p>\n\n<p>Option A</p>\n\n<p>(C) and (E) only</p>"}]}